      "type": "text",
      "style": "normal",
      "text": "NEIL is a short animated film created by Martin Pošta as a final bachelor's project on Film Academy of Performing Arts in Prague (FAMU) in the animation department.\n\n*In order to fulfill his dream, Neil The Space Bear lands with his spaceship after a long and stressful journey on an unknown planet. Without knowing what the future holds he sets off for an abandoned city where he may find what he has been looking for for so long…*"
